# Pairs with RestoredCutNotReAdvanced. The saga is declared complete as soon
# as one cluster has cut over, so that cluster resumes receiving while a
# laggard still ships its pre-restore writes.
MODULE: RestoredCutNotReAdvancedCompletesEarly
TARGET: RestoredCutNotReAdvanced
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: global completion is observed when any cluster, not every cluster, has cut over
PERTURBS: Complete

--- FIND
    /\ \/ rphase = "commit" /\ \A c \in Clusters : alias[c] = "new"
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: one cutover is taken for all.
    /\ \/ rphase = "commit" /\ \E c \in Clusters : alias[c] = "new"
--- END
